So I made the suggestion
to keep it quiet What?

214
00:22:19,560 --> 00:22:23,140
Oh, oh, shit So I was the
only one left out. Damn!

215
00:22:23,720 --> 00:22:24,550
Huh?

216
00:22:25,200 --> 00:22:26,030
Mmm.

217
